MILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">2. 신청 안내</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청 서류 및 장소 : 타대학 수학 신청원 1부.(첨부 파일), </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 각 종합학사행정실</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong><font color=\"#0000cd\">나. 신청 학점 : 18학점 이내</font></strong> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 기타</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 본교 성적 인정 과목을 각 전공 및 교양교직교육원에서 필히 확인</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;하여 작성</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 선수과목 이수 여부를 확인한 후 신청(첨부 파일)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#ff0000\">3) “8학기차 졸업예정자 및 2009학년도 2학기에 타대학 편입학 예정</font> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#ff0000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 자는 신청 불가</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>4) 이미 이수한 과목과 동일한 과목의 학점은 인정하지 않음.</strong> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(재수강 불가)</strong> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>5) 학적부 사진 미제출자는 신청 불가</strong> </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">3. 등록금 납부 :</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> 소속대학교에 납부</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">4. 수업 기간 :</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> 2009. 3. 2(월) ~ 6. 16(화)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><font color=\"#0000cd\"><strong><u><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">5. 신청 기한 :</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> 2009. 1. 19(월) 까지</font></span></u></strong></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">6. 수학 승인 :</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> 2009. 2. 18(수) 예정</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">7. 시간표 공고일</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> : 2009. 1. 16(금)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;경북대학교 홈페이지 → 학사 → 수업시간 및 강의계획서</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp; <font color=\"#0000cd\">[</font></font></span><a href=\"http://syllabus.knu.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#0000cd\">http://syllabus.knu.ac.kr]</font></span></a></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">8. 수강 신청 : </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">신청 서류에 의거 경북대학교 학사과에서 일괄 입력</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">9. </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">수강신청내역 확인</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"> : 승인 후, 경북대학교 홈페이지 → 학사 → </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span><a href=\"http://www.knu.ac.kr/dream/haksa.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>학사정보조회</strong></font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">에서 조회</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;* 학번 : 수학승인 시 부여되는 학번을 입력 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp; * 비밀번호 : 주민등록번호 뒤의</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;7자리</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">10. 수강신청 변경</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 변경기간 : 2009. 3. 9(월) ~ 3. 10(화)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 88.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -88.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 변경방법 : 변경기간 내에 홈페이지 접속<font color=\"#0000cd\">[</font> </font></span><a href=\"http://sugang.knu.ac.kr/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\" color=\"#0000cd\">http://sugang.knu.ac.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><font color=\"#0000cd\">]</font> → 학번 및 비밀번호 로그인 → 학생 본인이 직접 수강과목을 변경할 수 있음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">11. 수강취소(2과목 이내로 취소가능)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 30.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -30.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 취소기간 : 2009. 4. 28(화) ~ 4. 29(수)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 96.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -96.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 취소방법 : 학생 본인이 취소기간 내에 수강신청취소원을 작성하여 담당교수의 날인을 받은 후, 경북대 학사과로 제출</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">12. 기 타</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 개 강 일 : 2009. 3. 2(월)</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수학이 허가된 학생에게는 학생증을 발급하며 도서관 등의 시설물을 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이용할 수 있음</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 155%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 155%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 경북대학교 학사과 : ☎ 053-950-5091~3</font></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"></font></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\" size=\"4\"><strong>2008.&nbsp; &nbsp;1.&nbsp;&nbsp; 12</strong></font></span></p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><font size=\"4\"><strong></strong></font></font></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font face=\"굴림체\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>교&nbsp; 무&nbsp; 연&nbsp; 구&nbsp; 과&nbsp; 장</strong></font></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
